  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into fries.\n• Place fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the fries between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340185a756d38d6af3075a/step-1a623100.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop brown onion and garlic.\n• In a small saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium heat. Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add passata, the salt (for the sauce), brown sugar and butter and stir to combine.\n• Reduce heat to low and simmer, stirring occasionally, 3-4 minutes. Remove from heat. Little cooks: Don your goggles and have a go at peeling off the onion's outer layer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340185a756d38d6af3075a/step-66657310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340185a756d38d6af3075a/step-0c52e220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer to plant-based crumbed chicken to a second lined oven tray.\n• Top chicken with parmigiana sauce, then sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.\n• Bake until cheese is melted and chicken is cooked through (when no longer pink inside), 8-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340185a756d38d6af3075a/step-1d9c8230.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop snacking tomatoes.\n• In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of olive oil and balsamic vinegar. Season, then add tomato and rocket leaves. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340185a756d38d6af3075a/step-f4ada340.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide baked plant-based crumbed chicken parmigiana, sweet potato fries and garden salad between plates.\n• Tear over parsley to serve. Enjoy! Little cooks: Add the finishing touch by sprinkling over the remaining parsley!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340185a756d38d6af3075a/step-864ec750.jpg"
    }
  ]
